# Upload only the immutable runtime build context. Local outputs, the frontend,
# credentials, tests, and untracked experiments must never enter Cloud Build.
*
!.gcloudignore
!README.md
!pyproject.toml
!requirements.lock
!config/
!config/**
!src/
!src/**
# The GCP collector validates the same 12-source policy as the Worker.  Keep
# this one policy file in the image without uploading the frontend bundle.
!site/
!site/data/
!site/data/discovery-sources.json
